    "text": "In a box, there are <math><mn>20</mn></math> cards, out of which <math><mn>10</mn></math> are labelled as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and the remaining <math><mn>10</mn></math> are labelled as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> . Cards are drawn at random, one after the other and with replacement, till a second <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> card is obtained. The probability that the second <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> card appears before the third <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> card is:"
